# Ben Hickman Photography — Figma Design System Rules

Source of truth for design: **[Ben Hickman — Design System](https://www.figma.com/design/ZAIUGIPWRXFWsy1SwkIsg7)** (`fileKey: ZAIUGIPWRXFWsy1SwkIsg7`).

Code lives in `portfolio/` — an **Astro 5** site with **Tailwind CSS v4**, **Sanity CMS**, and semantic CSS tokens.

---

## Figma MCP Integration — Required Flow

Do not skip these steps when implementing or updating UI from Figma:

1. Run `get_design_context` for the exact Figma node (use `fileKey` + `nodeId` from the design file).
2. If the response is truncated, run `get_metadata` for the page map, then re-fetch only the needed nodes.
3. Run `get_screenshot` for a visual reference of the variant being built.
4. Download assets from the MCP payload when provided. Use localhost asset URLs directly — do not substitute placeholders.
5. Translate MCP output (often React + Tailwind) into **Astro components** using this project's tokens and existing components.
6. Validate 1:1 look and behavior against the screenshot before marking complete.

---

## Component Organization

- **Shared UI components:** `portfolio/src/components/` (PascalCase `.astro` files)
- **Essay/poem blocks:** `portfolio/src/components/essay/`, `portfolio/src/components/essays/`, `portfolio/src/components/poem/`, `portfolio/src/components/poems/`
- **Layouts:** `portfolio/src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro` wraps Nav, Footer, ChatAgent
- **Pages:** `portfolio/src/pages/` (file-based routing)
- **Data:** `portfolio/src/lib/queries.ts` (Sanity), `portfolio/src/lib/sanity.ts`

### Figma component → code mapping

| Figma component | Code file | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Label / Meta | `.label-meta` utility | `global.css` — also inline `text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]` |
| Arrow Link | `components/ArrowLink.astro` | Material Icons `east` arrow |
| Theme Switch | `components/Nav.astro` | `.theme-switch` / `.theme-switch-knob` scoped styles |
| Footer | `components/Footer.astro` | `.label-footer` pattern |
| Filter Tab | `pages/writing/index.astro` | `.filter-tab` scoped styles |
| Writing Row | `pages/writing/index.astro` | `.writing-row` scoped styles |
| Nav | `components/Nav.astro` | Fixed top nav, Lottie logo, theme toggle |
| Photo Card | `components/PhotoCard.astro` | Grid layout, `reverse` prop |
| Pull Quote | `components/essay/PullQuoteBlock.astro` | `.pull-quote` styled in essay pages |
| Scroll Indicator | `components/HeroSection.astro` | Scroll affordance at section bottom |
| Hero Section | `components/HeroSection.astro` | Fluid `.heading-hero` + `.massive-text` |
| Lightbox | `components/Lightbox.astro` | Full-screen overlay, Material Icons |
| Chat Agent | `components/ChatAgent.astro` | Floating widget — **migrate `stone-*` to design tokens** |

IMPORTANT: Before creating a new component, check the table above and reuse or extend the existing file.

