## Design Tokens

Tokens are defined in `portfolio/src/styles/tokens.css` and exposed to Tailwind via `@theme` in `portfolio/src/styles/global.css`.

### Color tokens (Light / Dark via `[data-theme="dark"]`)

| Figma variable | CSS variable | Tailwind utility |
|---|---|---|
| `color/surface` | `--color-surface` | `bg-surface` |
| `color/surface-dark` | `--color-surface-dark` | `bg-surface-dark` |
| `color/text/primary` | `--color-text-primary` | `text-primary` |
| `color/text/muted` | `--color-text-muted` | `text-muted` |
| `color/text/subtle` | `--color-text-subtle` | `text-subtle` |
| `color/border` | `--color-border` | `border-border-color-DEFAULT` |
| `color/overlay` | `--color-overlay` | Use `var(--color-overlay)` or semantic classes |
| `color/overlay-hover` | `--color-overlay-hover` | Hover states on overlays |

IMPORTANT: Never hardcode hex colors or use arbitrary Tailwind palette colors (`stone-*`, `gray-*`) for UI that maps to the design system. Use semantic tokens above.

