| `spacing/compact` | `--space-compact` | `spacing-compact` | 12px |
| `spacing/inline` | `--space-inline` | `spacing-inline` | 16px |
| `spacing/input` | `--space-input` | `spacing-input` | 20px |
| `spacing/md` | `--space-md` | `spacing-md` | 24px |
| `spacing/block` | `--space-block` | `spacing-block` | 32px |
| `spacing/card-x` | `--space-card-x` | `spacing-card-x` | 40px |
| `spacing/lg` | `--space-lg` | `spacing-lg` | 48px |
| `spacing/comfortable` | `--space-comfortable` | `spacing-comfortable` | 64px |
| `spacing/xl` | `--space-xl` | `spacing-xl` | 80px |
| `spacing/2xl` | `--space-2xl` | `spacing-2xl` | 96px |
| `spacing/section` | `--space-section` | `spacing-section` | 128px |
| `spacing/3xl` | `--space-3xl` | `spacing-3xl` | 160px |

**Radius:**

| Figma variable | CSS variable | Tailwind | Value |
|---|---|---|---|
| `radius/card` | `--radius-card` | `rounded-card` | 8px |
| `radius/pill` | `--radius-pill` | `rounded-pill` | 10px |
| `radius/md` | `--radius-md` | `rounded-md` | 16px |
| `radius/input` | `--radius-input` | `rounded-input` | 20px |
| `radius/logo` | `--radius-logo` | `rounded-logo` | 34px |
| `radius/full` | `--radius-full` | `rounded-full` | 999px |

Prefer semantic Tailwind utilities (`p-spacing-md`, `gap-spacing-inline`, `rounded-card`) or CSS variables directly.

### Typography

| Figma variable | CSS variable | Font |
|---|---|---|
| `font/display` | `--font-display` | Instrument Serif |
| `font/sans` | `--font-sans` | Inter |

Use `font-display` and `font-sans` Tailwind utilities. Do not import additional font families.

### Motion

| Token | CSS variable | Value |
|---|---|---|
| Fast | `--duration-fast` | 300ms |
| Medium | `--duration-medium` | 500ms |
| Slow | `--duration-slow` | 700ms |
| Easing | `--ease-default` | `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` |

Body theme transitions use `duration-500` on `body` — match for theme-aware UI.

