## Typography Scale (20 text styles)

Map Figma text styles to code using these patterns. Semantic meaning (placeholder, muted, active) is carried by **color tokens**, not duplicate styles.

### Display (Instrument Serif)

| Figma style | Code pattern |
|---|---|
| `Display/Cover` | Large cover titles — `font-display`, ~96px fixed in Figma; use fluid sizing only when matching live hero |
| `Heading/Massive` | `.massive-text` utility in `global.css` (fluid viewport sizing) |
| `Heading/Hero` | `.heading-hero` utility (fluid viewport sizing) |
| `Heading/Card` | `font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.05]` (PhotoCard) |
| `Heading/Page` | `font-display text-5xl` (~48px) |
| `Heading/Section` | `.heading-section` → `text-4xl font-display` |
| `Heading/Writing Row` | `font-display text-[1.75rem]` in writing rows |
| `Pull Quote` | `.pull-quote` — Instrument Serif Italic, styled in essay page `<style>` blocks |

### Documentation headings (Inter Bold — docs/marketing only)

| Figma style | Size |
|---|---|
| `Heading/Documentation` | 28px / 32px lh |
| `Heading/Subsection` | 24px / 28px lh |
| `Heading/Section Docs` | 18px / 24px lh |

### Body (Inter)

| Figma style | Code pattern |
|---|---|
| `Body/Large` | `text-base leading-6` (16px) |
| `Body/Default` | `.body-default` → `text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted` (14px Light) |
| `Body/Caption` | `text-[0.8125rem]` (13px) |
| `Body/Small` | `text-xs` (12px) — chips, subtitles, meta lines |

### Labels & UI (Inter)

| Figma style | Code pattern |
|---|---|
| `Label/Meta` | `.label-meta` or `text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]` |
| `Label/Footer` | `.label-footer` or `text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-subtle` |
| `Label/Medium` | `text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em]` |
| `Label/UI` | `text-[9px] uppercase` (scroll labels) |
| `UI/Icon Label` | `text-[11px]` (icon-adjacent labels) |

